content.text:
Invalid `prisma.bounties.findMany()` invocation:

{
  include: {
    claims: {
      take: 1,
      where: {
        ban: {
          none: {}
        }
      }
    },
    participations: {
      select: {
        userAddress: true
      },
      take: 2
    },
    extra: {
      select: {
        amountSort: true
      }
    }
  },
  where: {
    isCanceled: false,
    ban: {
      none: {}
    },
    inProgress: true,
    isVoting: false,
    createdAt: {
      lt: "garbage"
          ~~~~~~~~~
    }
  },
  distinct: "id",
  orderBy: {
    createdAt: "desc"
  },
  take: 5
}

Invalid value for argument `lt`: cannot parse integer from empty string. Expected decimal String.
